     "rx": "turbo(charger)?s? (fail|failed|failure|leak|leaking|went out)|blown turbo|white smoke|thrust bearing",
     "x": "On 2016–2018 Infiniti Q50 and 2017–2018 Q60 with this engine, turbo bearings can wear early and leak oil inside, causing white smoke, a check-engine light and sometimes lost power. Owners of later Q50s report the same in NHTSA complaints.",
