     "rx": "grind(s|ing)? (into|in) (second|2nd)|second gear|2nd gear",
     "x": "In late 2022 Nissan held all manual 2023 Zs at dealers over second-gear shifting, then replaced the gearbox on 174 cars with a manufacturing fault.",
